        "title": "Night Golf — source archive",
        "html": "<p><strong>Source archive — this event has passed.</strong></p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6465251e31edb2766a14ae9b/1763140019964-WH2Z34D4XKVMU5Y5M8Y4/Night+Golf+Poster+%285%29.png\" alt=\"Night Golf\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1545\" height=\"2000\">\n</p>\n<ul><li><time>Saturday, November 15, 2025</time> </li>\n<li><time>2:00 PM</time> \n\n<time>11:59 PM</time> </li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/calendar/event?action=TEMPLATE&amp;text=Night%20Golf&amp;dates=20251115T210000Z/20251116T065900Z\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Google Calendar</a> \n<a href=\"https://sparrow-sheep-7aha.squarespace.com/events/night-golf-1?format=ical\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ICS</a></li></ul>\n<p><strong>Night Golf at Artesia Country Club</strong></p>\n<p>Artesia Country Club invites you to join us for our Night Golf event on November 15.</p>\n<p><strong>Event Details:</strong></p>\n<ul><li><p>Date: November 15</p></li><li><p>Tee Time: 2 PM</p></li><li><p>Registration Fee: <strong>$100 per player</strong></p></li><li><p>Additional green fee and cart fee apply for non-members</p></li><li><p>Six-person teams</p></li></ul>\n<p><strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul><li><p>Night golf supplies</p></li><li><p>Dinner for each registered participant</p></li></ul>\n<p>Additional meals may be purchased for $20 per person.</p>\n<p>For more information or to register, please contact the Pro Shop at <strong>575-746-6732</strong>.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sparrow-sheep-7aha.squarespace.com/events/night-golf-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View Event →</a></p>",
